    <title>Gramless Analysis 2</title>
    <body>
        <p>Some background to this set of questions. Analyze operational parameters and system performance.</p>
        <p>
            <simpletable frame="all" relcolwidth="2.0* 0.5* 2.0*" outputclass="qd-quiz">
                <sthead>
                    <stentry>Question</stentry>
                    <stentry>Answer</stentry>
                    <stentry>Detail</stentry>
                </sthead>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>What is the optimal operating frequency (in kHz) for this scenario?</stentry>
                    <stentry>5</stentry>
                    <stentry>1</stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>Which sonar mode is most appropriate for this environment?</stentry>
                    <stentry>1</stentry>
                    <stentry>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Active search mode with medium pulse length</li>
                            <li>Passive listen-only mode</li>
                            <li>High-frequency imaging mode</li>
                            <li>Doppler velocity tracking</li>
                        </ol>
                    </stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>What is the expected maximum detection range (in meters)?</stentry>
                    <stentry>5000</stentry>
                    <stentry>500</stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>Should you adjust power levels for ambient noise?</stentry>
                    <stentry>1</stentry>
                    <stentry>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Yes, increase power to overcome background noise</li>
                            <li>No, keep power constant regardless of conditions</li>
                            <li>Only during night operations</li>
                            <li>Power adjustment is not permitted</li>
                        </ol>
                    </stentry>
                </strow>
            </simpletable>
        </p>
    </body>
